guard:wasm label_response input JSON (4015 bytes): {"capabilities":{},"tool_args":{"direction":"desc","owner":"jeffhandley","perPage":50,"repo":"dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager","sort":"updated","state":"all"},"tool_name":"list_pull_requests","tool_result":{"content":[{"text":"[{\"number\":6,\"title\":\"[release/9.0] Update dependencies from dotnet/arcade\",\"body\":\"Automated dependency flow. Should be ruled OUT by classification.\",\"state\":\"open\",\"draft\":false,\"merged\":false,\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/pull/6\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jeffhandley\",\"id\":1031940,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1031940?v=4\"},\"labels\":[\"Servicing-approved\",\"area-codeflow\"],\"head\":{\"ref\":\"mock/codeflow\",\"sha\":\"2ae89cf7a3ab723856bdd5f6bf0a28978927ca70\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"base\":{\"ref\":\"release/9.0\",\"sha\":\"e78294e3b7891a40c4e0a3934015e1c0f4c0018c\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:34:51Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:34:52Z\"},{\"number\":5,\"title\":\"[release/9.0] Fix Math.Round(0.5) midpoint to round away from zero\",\"body\":\"## Customer Impact\\n- [x] Customer reported\\n\\nFixes #20 (mock). `Math.Round(0.5)` returns `0` (banker\\u0026#39;s rounding) instead of `1`.\\\\n\\\\n### Expected Result\\\\n`Math.Round(0.5)` returns `1`\\\\n\\\\n### Actual Result\\\\n`Math.Round(0.5)` returns `0`\\\\n\\\\n```csharp\\\\nSystem.Console.WriteLine(System.Math.Round(0.5)); // prints 0, expected 1\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## Regression?\\\\n- [ ] No\",\"state\":\"open\",\"draft\":false,\"merged\":false,\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/pull/5\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jeffhandley\",\"id\":1031940,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1031940?v=4\"},\"labels\":[\"Servicing-approved\",\"area-System.Runtime\"],\"head\":{\"ref\":\"mock/round-half\",\"sha\":\"5acf02f17790d465c0247d1efc18a1c4082c42bc\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"base\":{\"ref\":\"release/9.0\",\"sha\":\"e78294e3b7891a40c4e0a3934015e1c0f4c0018c\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:34:30Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:34:31Z\"},{\"number\":1,\"title\":\"[release/9.0] Fix Math.Round to round .5 midpoints away from zero\",\"body\":\"## Customer Impact\\n- [x] Customer reported\\n\\nFixes #1 (mock). `Math.Round(double)` uses banker\\u0026#39;s rounding by default, so `Math.Round(2.5)` returns `2` instead of `3`. Customers porting from frameworks that round half away from zero get wrong totals.\\\\n\\\\n### Expected Result\\\\n`Math.Round(2.5)` returns `3`\\\\n\\\\n### Actual Result\\\\n`Math.Round(2.5)` returns `2`\\\\n\\\\n```csharp\\\\nSystem.Console.WriteLine(System.Math.Round(2.5)); // prints 2, expected 3\\\\n```\\\\n\\\\n## Regression?\\\\n- [ ] No\\\\n\\\\n## Risk\\\\nLow.\",\"state\":\"open\",\"draft\":false,\"merged\":false,\"html_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager/pull/1\",\"user\":{\"login\":\"jeffhandley\",\"id\":1031940,\"profile_url\":\"https://github.com/jeffhandley\",\"avatar_url\":\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1031940?v=4\"},\"labels\":[\"Servicing-approved\",\"area-System.Runtime\"],\"head\":{\"ref\":\"mock/math-round-fix\",\"sha\":\"ddc997cc41db75a493f242a4be5f6a10ef9f78dc\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"base\":{\"ref\":\"release/9.0\",\"sha\":\"e78294e3b7891a40c4e0a3934015e1c0f4c0018c\",\"repo\":{\"full_name\":\"jeffhandley/dotnet-runtime-servicing-release-manager\"}},\"created_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:05:13Z\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-06-28T10:29:45Z\"}]","type":"text"}]}} +834µs
